elow VAT in elastomers, seals, precision-machined valve parts, coatings and=
 service consumables.</p>
<p>Falsifiers: tool architectures consolidate chambers/process steps; valve=
 reuse/service intervals lengthen; the current order surge proves mostly in=
ventory prebuild rather than sustained process-content growth.</p>
